# App

The model as an app of interactive panels: every simulation runs in your browser, on the model compiled to WebAssembly by [sbmlsim-core](https://matthiaskoenig.github.io/sbmlsim-core/), with the panels of [sbmlsim-web](https://matthiaskoenig.github.io/sbmlsim-web/). The app is one file, [`{{ app }}`]({{ app }}), which needs no server and no network: [open it in its own window]({{ app }}) or download it and open it from your disk. The factory writes it with the models, so it is the app of the models of this release ([`models/{{ app }}`]({{ settings.raw_url }}models/{{ app }})).

